1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:01,755
Install Ownit.

2
00:00:02,039 --> 00:00:05,850
Then run the login command and sign in
with GitHub in your browser.

3
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,704
Run the key command.

4
00:00:08,988 --> 00:00:13,930
Choose Nebius or NVIDIA, and paste your
API key at the hidden prompt.

5
00:00:14,947 --> 00:00:17,376
In your project, run Ownit init.

6
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,668
Install the GitHub app for that repo when
prompted.

7
00:00:20,949 --> 00:00:22,155
Setup is done.

8
00:00:23,213 --> 00:00:25,261
You've added a search box to your shop.

9
00:00:25,545 --> 00:00:28,632
Push your code, and choose yes to start
the interview.

10
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,793
Why did you add a search box to the shop?

11
00:00:32,077 --> 00:00:35,204
So customers can quickly find the product
they want.

12
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,898
What happens when someone searches for
shoes?

13
00:00:41,183 --> 00:00:44,191
The shop only shows products with shoes in
the name.

14
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,135
Both answers passed.

15
00:00:49,419 --> 00:00:51,098
Your push is verified.

16
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:54,072
Two short answers to explain the code you
ship.
